<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
	<title th:text="{{concat "#{title." viewNameLower ".sample}"}}"></title>

	<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" th:href="@{/css/component/output.css}"/>
	<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" th:href="@{/css/egovframe.css}"/>
	<script th:inline="javascript" th:src="@{/js/jquery.min.js}"></script>
	<script th:inline="javascript">
		function {{viewNameLower}}Search() {
			document.listForm.pageIndex.value = 1;
			document.listForm.submit();
		}
		function {{viewNameLower}}Pagination(pageNo) {
			document.listForm.pageIndex.value = pageNo;
			document.listForm.submit();
		}
	</script>
</head>
<body>
<div id="container" class="inner">

	<h2 class="heading-large" th:text="{{concat "#{list." viewNameLower "}"}}"></h2>

	<!-- @egov:nav-include — egov_add_entity / egov_add_query_view 가 fragment 갱신 시 자동 인식하는 마커. -->
	<div th:replace="~{_fragments/nav :: links}"></div>

	<div id="content_pop">
		<form id="listForm" name="listForm" th:object="${ {{viewVoName}} }" method="get" th:action="@{/egov{{viewName}}List.do}">
			<input type="hidden" name="pageIndex" th:value="${ {{viewVoName}}.pageIndex }"/>

{{#if hasSearchable}}
			<div class="form-group">
				<div class="search-wrap">
					<div class="search-body">
						<div class="form-conts searchOption">
							<select id="searchCondition" name="searchCondition" class="krds-form-select medium" th:title="#{search.choose}">
{{#each searchable}}
								<option th:text="{{concat "#{title." ../viewNameLower "." alias "}"}}" th:value="{{@index}}" th:selected="${ {{../viewVoName}}.searchCondition } == {{@index}}"></option>
{{/each}}
							</select>
						</div>
						<div class="form-conts btn-ico-wrap searchKeyword">
							<input type="text" id="searchKeyword" name="searchKeyword" th:value="${ {{viewVoName}}.searchKeyword }" class="krds-input medium" th:placeholder="#{search.keyword}">
							<button type="button" class="krds-btn medium icon" th:onclick="{{viewNameLower}}Search()">
								<span class="sr-only" th:text="#{button.search}"></span>
								<i class="svg-icon ico-sch"></i>
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
{{/if}}

			<div class="krds-table-wrap">
				<table class="tbl data">
					<thead>
						<tr>
							<th scope="col" class="text-center">No</th>
{{#each columns}}
							<th scope="col" class="text-center"><span th:text="{{concat "#{title." ../viewNameLower "." alias "}"}}"></span></th>
{{/each}}
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody>
						<tr th:each="result, iterStat : ${resultList}">
							<td class="text-center" th:text="${paginationInfo.totalRecordCount + 1 - (({{viewVoName}}.pageIndex - 1) * {{viewVoName}}.pageSize + iterStat.count)}"></td>
{{#each columns}}
{{#if isDate}}
							<td class="text-center" th:text="${result.{{alias}} != null} ? ${#dates.format(result.{{alias}}, '{{format}}')} : ''"></td>
{{else if isTimestamp}}
							<td class="text-center" th:text="${result.{{alias}} != null} ? ${#dates.format(result.{{alias}}, '{{format}}')} : ''"></td>
{{else if isNumber}}
{{#if format}}
							<td class="text-right" th:text="${result.{{alias}} != null} ? ${#numbers.formatDecimal(result.{{alias}}, 1, '{{numberGrouping}}', {{numberDecimals}}, 'POINT')} : ''"></td>
{{else}}
							<td class="text-right" th:text="{{concat "${result." alias "}"}}"></td>
{{/if}}
{{else if isBoolean}}
							<td class="text-center" th:text="{{concat "${result." alias " != null and result." alias "}"}} ? #{input.yes} : #{input.no}"></td>
{{else}}
							<td class="text-center" th:text="{{concat "${result." alias "}"}}"></td>
{{/if}}
{{/each}}
						</tr>
						<tr th:if="${resultList == null or resultList.isEmpty()}">
							<td class="text-center" colspan="{{add columns.length 1}}" th:text="#{info.nodata.msg}"></td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>

			<!--
				th:utext 사용 근거 (XSS safe — verified, not assumed):

				1) org.egovframe.rte.ptl.mvc.tags.ui.pagination.PaginationInfo 는 int 9개만 필드로 가짐
				   (currentPageNo/recordCountPerPage/pageSize/totalRecordCount/totalPageCount/
				    firstPageNoOnPageList/lastPageNoOnPageList/firstRecordIndex/lastRecordIndex).
				   String 필드 0개, setSearchKeyword 없음. 사용자 입력이 들어갈 수 있는 구조 자체가 아니다.
				2) AbstractPaginationRenderer.renderPagination(...) 는 paginationInfo 에서 int getter
				   만 호출하고 Integer.toString(int) 로 변환. 임의 문자열이 흘러나올 경로 없음.
				3) jsFunction 인자는 생성 시점에 ^[A-Z][a-zA-Z0-9]*$ 로 검증된 식별자 리터럴.
				4) label 템플릿(이전/다음 등)은 EgovKrdsPaginationRenderer 의 하드코드 + 우리 message
				   bundle 만 사용 — 둘 다 개발자 통제.

				위 4가지가 깨지지 않는 한 안전. 셀(<td>) 값은 모두 th:text 로 escape 되어 있다.
			-->
			<div id="paging" class="krds-pagination w-page" th:utext="${#egovKrdsPaginationRenderer.renderPagination(paginationInfo, '{{viewNameLower}}Pagination')}"></div>
		</form>
	</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
